 Movement-based locomotion\n\ud83c\udf4c Banana traps and power-ups\n\ud83c\udf10 Multiplayer chaos\n\ud83c\udfad Cosmetic customization\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Unique, community-inspired maps\n\nNo rules. No limits. Just monkey business.\nCan you become the top banana?", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf4c Banana Game \u2013 A Gorilla Tag Fan Game\n\nClimb walls, swing through trees, and dodge slippery banana traps as you chase or escape your friends in fast-paced tag matches. Customize your monkey, unlock sill"}]}, "developer_name": "MayhemLLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/10LZnuwhqBHZHpjVe02BDMyLzWdFnv7wOBcf5jeHVVxw/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Nightmare", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scary-chubz/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "23999787552962510"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "24017472244527374", "version": "1.3"}, "id": "1356458955564196", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary